      <itemfeedback ident="2753_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Self-assessment is defined in the chapter vocabulary as the evaluation of one's own performance or abilities. Instructor feedback comes from an outside evaluator, not the writer. Reviewing outside sources is part of the research process. A grammar checklist is an editing tool. Self-assessment is an internal process where the writer honestly examines their own strengths and areas for improvement.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
