        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="46841_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The three stages specific to reflective writing are exploration (describing what happened), reflection (analyzing what it means), and action (planning what to do next). Research, drafting, and editing describe the general writing process. Introduction, body, and conclusion describe essay structure. Summarizing, quoting, and paraphrasing are research writing skills.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="23589_fb">
