            <mattext texttype="text/html">The chapter defines exploration as the first stage of reflection where the writer describes what happened. Analyzing what was learned describes the reflection stage. Planning how to apply insights describes the action stage. Gathering sources is a research writing skill, not a stage of reflective writing.</mattext>
