      <itemfeedback ident="98982_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading identifies asking AI to generate the reflection itself as the most common misuse. This produces content that sounds reasonable but describes no one in particular, with fabricated experiences and generic insights. Asking AI to check grammar, suggest prompts for the writer to answer personally, and evaluate the specificity of an action plan are all identified in the reading as appropriate uses of AI in reflective writing.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
