            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading states that countries like Finland and Sweden incorporate structured reflection through learning journals that connect theoretical knowledge with practical applications and personal growth. Yarning circles are associated with Indigenous Australian communities. Hansei-kai meetings are associated with Japanese culture. Testimonios are associated with Latin American reflective traditions.</mattext>
          </material>
