            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading includes the reflection prompt Ada reviews, which asks: "What did you learn? What strengths did you discover? What will you continue to develop? Be specific. Be honest. Show us how you think about your own learning." The other options do not match the prompt described in the reading. The prompt focuses on learning, strengths, and growth — not sources, grades, or time management alone.</mattext>
